This placeholder is committed on purpose.

web/embed.go carries //go:embed all:dist, and a Go embed pattern that matches
nothing is a compile error — not a warning. Without a tracked file here, a
fresh clone fails `go build ./...`, `go test ./...`, `go install`, and every
editor running gopls, with:

    web/embed.go:8:12: pattern all:dist: no matching files found

`make build` hides this because it builds the UI first. Everything else does
not.
